1051017,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gZi4J","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T16:19:01Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T16:19:01Z","body":"To clarify, there is a limit to each type of RID. So you should not be leaking RIDs. By creating a new uniform buffer every frame you are leaking RIDs and running out. \n\nThe solution is to just create one uniform buffer when you initialize the effect and then reuse it each frame","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691051017/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691065593","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103400#issuecomment-2691065593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103400","id":2691065593,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gZmb5","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T16:26:40Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T16:26:40Z","body":"Freeing this would increase the limit as well, but not sure when and how to free it, but if it's possible the safest way would be to reuse it","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691065593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691172813","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103400#issuecomment-2691172813","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103400","id":2691172813,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gaAnN","user":{"login":"fLindahl","id":18470258,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDcwMjU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18470258?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl","html_url":"https://github.com/fLindahl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T17:20:17Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T17:20:17Z","body":"If I want to cache it, I also need to be able to update it. Is there a way to do this? I can't find any relevant functions in the RenderingDevice and I honestly don't know where else to look for it . Halp","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691172813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691179649","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103400#issuecomment-2691179649","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103400","id":2691179649,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gaCSB","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T17:23:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T17:23:51Z","body":"You should be able to use [`RenderingDevice.buffer_update`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_renderingdevice.html#class-renderingdevice-method-buffer-update)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691179649/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691580800","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103400#issuecomment-2691580800","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103400","id":2691580800,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gbkOA","user":{"login":"fLindahl","id":18470258,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDcwMjU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18470258?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl","html_url":"https://github.com/fLindahl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fLindahl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T21:32:09Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T21:32:09Z","body":"Worked wonders! Thanks a lot to both of you!\n\nFor those who stumble upon this later:\n\nI initialized a buffer once with:\n\n```gdscript\nvar pb = PackedByteArray()\npb.resize(256) # num bytes required for the uniform buffer\npb.fill(0)\n\nmat_buffer =  rd.uniform_buffer_create(256, pb)\n```\n\nand then updated the buffer per frame with:\n\n```gdscript\nvar pb = PackedByteArray()\n\n# fill array with whatever necessary\n\nrd.buffer_update(mat_buffer, 0, 256, pb)\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691580800/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]